:: LostLamb Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'lost-lamb-links'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.links>>
    <<if $LostLamb.tidied>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>There is still a clear space beside the keyboard. Kylar has kept the papers stacked on the other side.
        <<option 'CN'>>键盘旁仍空着一小块地方。凯拉尔把那叠纸留在了另一侧。
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask about the monstrance', '问起圣体匣'] 'LostLamb Talk'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<if $LostLamb.talked and $LostLamb.stance isnot 'temple' and !$LostLamb.tidied>>
      <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Stay and tidy the desk together (0:15)', '留下来一起整理书桌 (0:15)'] 'LostLamb Desk'>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').tidy()>><<pass 15>><</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: LostLamb Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.available>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You ask Kylar about the monstrance upstairs. <<He>> turns away from the monitors, but does not quite meet your eyes.
      <br><br>
      "I don't know," <<he>> says. "I told you. I don't think they were religious."
      <<if $LostLamb.talked>>
        <<He>> rubs <<his>> hands together. "You're still thinking about it?"
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if ['initiate', 'monk', 'priest'].includes($temple_rank)>>
        "You're going to tell the temple, aren't you?" <<His>> voice tightens. "They don't get to decide what happens here."
      <<else>>
        "Don't tell the temple." <<He>> glances at the door, then back at you. "I don't want them here."
      <</if>>
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        "Who else have you told?" <<he>> asks, watching your face.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问起楼上的圣体匣。凯拉尔从显示器前转过身，却没有直视你的眼睛。
      <br><br>
      “我不知道。”<<he>>说，“我说过了。我不觉得他们信教。”
      <<if $LostLamb.talked>>
        <<He>>搓着双手。“你还在想那件事？”
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if ['initiate', 'monk', 'priest'].includes($temple_rank)>>
        “你要告诉神殿，对吧？”<<His>>的声音绷紧了。“这里的事轮不到他们决定。”
      <<else>>
        “别告诉神殿。”<<He>>看了一眼门，又看向你。“我不想让他们来这里。”
      <</if>>
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        “你还告诉过谁？”<<he>>问，紧盯着你的脸。
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Listen to Kylar', '听凯拉尔说'] 'LostLamb Reply'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').choose('listen')>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').truth>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Tell Kylar what the bishop said about the manor', '告诉凯拉尔主教对庄园的说法'] 'LostLamb Reply'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').choose('truth')>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reported>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Tell Kylar you already asked Jordan', '坦白你已经问过约旦'] 'LostLamb Reply'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').choose('report')>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Say you want to understand before deciding', '表示想先弄清楚，再作决定'] 'LostLamb Reply'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').choose('boundary')>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'angry'>><<lanLink ['Insist the temple should investigate', '坚持让神殿调查'] 'LostLamb Reply'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').choose('temple')>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You cannot talk to Kylar about this here right now.
    <<option 'CN'>>你现在无法在这里和凯拉尔谈这件事。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the bedroom', '返回卧室'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: LostLamb Reply
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.available and $LostLamb.talked>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<switch $LostLamb.stance>>
        <<case 'listen'>>
          You ask what Kylar thinks. <<He>> looks down at <<his>> hands.
          <br><br>
          "Why did they show us? They could have kept it up there." <<He>> pauses. "Maybe they wanted us to do something. I don't know what."
          <br><br>
          <<He>> looks up. "You're not going to stop coming here, are you?"
        <<case 'report'>>
          You tell Kylar you described the monstrance to Jordan. <<He>> goes still.
          <br><br>
          "You told them about the house?" <<He>> pushes <<his>> chair back. "What did they say?"
          <br><br>
          You explain that Jordan warned you not to return. Kylar looks towards the door.
          <br><br>
          "Of course they did." <<His>> fingers tighten on the chair. "You came back, though."
        <<case 'boundary'>>
          You say you want to understand what happened before deciding what to do.
          <br><br>
          "Then ask me first." Kylar hesitates. "I might not know. But you could still ask."
          <br><br>
          "I don't want people coming here and deciding what to do with them." <<He>> looks down. "They're my parents."
        <<case 'truth'>>
          You describe what the bishop told you: the manor's owners had dealings with Auriga's servants, and the temple punished them. You make it clear that this is the bishop's account. The bishop refused to explain everything.
          <br><br>
          Kylar stares at you. "They did this to them?"
          <br><br>
          <<He>> looks towards the door. "I don't know what they did. They never told me." <<His>> hands close into fists. "But they're still my parents."
          <br><br>
          "Don't bring that person here." <<He>> turns back to you. "You won't, will you?"
        <<case 'temple'>>
          You say the temple should investigate. Kylar shakes <<his>> head.
          <br><br>
          "No. You don't get to invite them here." <<His>> voice rises, then drops. "This is my home."
          <br><br>
          <<He>> turns back towards the monitors. The conversation is over for now.
      <</switch>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<switch $LostLamb.stance>>
        <<case 'listen'>>
          你问凯拉尔是怎么想的。<<He>>低头看着自己的手。
          <br><br>
          “他们为什么给我们看？明明可以一直放在上面。”<<He>>停顿了一下。“也许他们想让我们做什么。我不知道是什么。”
          <br><br>
          <<He>>抬起头。“你不会就不来这里了吧？”
        <<case 'report'>>
          你告诉凯拉尔，你向约旦描述过圣体匣。<<He>>僵住了。
          <br><br>
          “你告诉他们这栋房子的事了？”<<He>>把椅子向后推。“他们说什么？”
          <br><br>
          你解释，约旦警告你不要再回来。凯拉尔望向门口。
          <br><br>
          “他们当然会这么说。”<<His>>的手指攥紧了椅子。“不过，你还是回来了。”
        <<case 'boundary'>>
          你表示想先弄清发生了什么，再决定怎么办。
          <br><br>
          “那就先问我。”凯拉尔犹豫了一下。“我可能不知道。但你还是可以问我。”
          <br><br>
          “我不想让别人跑到这里，决定要怎么处置他们。”<<He>>垂下目光。“他们是我的父母。”
        <<case 'truth'>>
          你转述主教的说法：庄园的主人曾与奥里加的仆从打交道，神殿惩罚了他们。你说明，这些是主教告诉你的。主教并不愿意解释全部经过。
          <br><br>
          凯拉尔愣愣地看着你。“是他们把我的父母变成这样的？”
          <br><br>
          <<He>>望向门口。“我不知道他们做过什么。他们没告诉我。”<<His>>的双手握成拳头。“但他们还是我的父母。”
          <br><br>
          “别把那个人带到这里。”<<He>>重新看向你。“你不会的，对吧？”
        <<case 'temple'>>
          你说神殿应该调查。凯拉尔摇了摇头。
          <br><br>
          “不行。你不能把他们叫到这里。”<<His>>的声音提高了，随后又低下去。“这是我家。”
          <br><br>
          <<He>>转回显示器前。谈话暂时结束了。
      <</switch>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $LostLamb.stance isnot 'temple' and !$LostLamb.tidied>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>Kylar shifts a loose sheet of paper away from the keyboard. "You could stay a bit. If you want."
      <<option 'CN'>>凯拉尔把键盘旁的一张散纸挪开。“你可以再待一会儿。如果你愿意的话。”
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Stay and tidy the desk together (0:15)', '留下来一起整理书桌 (0:15)'] 'LostLamb Desk'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').tidy()>><<pass 15>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>The conversation will have to wait.
    <<option 'CN'>>这次交谈得等一等了。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the bedroom', '返回卧室'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: LostLamb Desk
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.available and $LostLamb.tidied>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You gather the loose papers at the edge of the desk. Kylar reaches over quickly. "Not those. I'll do those."
      <br><br>
      You leave the papers with <<him>> and clear a space beside the keyboard. <<He>> watches you for a moment, then starts stacking them. You do not touch the monitors or the cables behind them.
      <br><br>
      "I can find things," <<he>> mutters. "Usually."
      <br><br>
      When you finish, there is room for your hands on the desk. Kylar puts the stack on <<his>> side, keeping it within reach.
      <br><br>
      "You're staying?" <<He>> catches <<himself>>. "A bit longer, I mean."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你收拢书桌边缘的散纸。凯拉尔立刻伸过手来。“那些别动。我来整理。”
      <br><br>
      你把纸交给<<him>>，清出键盘旁的一小块地方。<<He>>看了你片刻，随后开始把纸叠起来。你没有碰显示器，也没有碰后面的线缆。
      <br><br>
      “我找得到东西。”<<he>>嘀咕道，“一般都找得到。”
      <br><br>
      整理完后，桌上有地方让你放手了。凯拉尔把那叠纸放在自己一侧，伸手就能拿到。
      <br><br>
      “你要留下来吗？”<<He>>顿了一下。“我是说，再待一会儿。”
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You cannot tidy the desk with Kylar right now.
    <<option 'CN'>>你现在无法和凯拉尔一起整理书桌。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the bedroom', '返回卧室'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>><br>
